{"channelId":"UCgdmfY9WmQHN5CCheQXhd0Q","row":["Dan The Dog Man",3930,"I’m Dan the Dog Man — a combat veteran and professional dog trainer with a background in canine psychology and animal behavior. Based on experience, not just theory. On this channel, I break down real-world dog training, focusing on behavior, obedience, and the root causes behind aggression, reactivity, and lack of control.\n\nI don’t just teach commands — I teach structure, communication, and how to build a clear relationship between dog and owner. You’ll see real training sessions, behavior modification, and step-by-step breakdowns in challenging situations like vet visits, leash reactivity, and high-drive dogs.\n\nMy approach is built on trust, respect, and clarity — creating calm, reliable dogs through consistent, real-world training. If you’re looking for dog training tips, behavior correction, and real case studies, this channel is for you. \n\nSubscribe for real, lasting results.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgdmfY9WmQHN5CCheQXhd0Q","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgdmfY9WmQHN5CCheQXhd0Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:52.375Z","channelId":"UCgdmfY9WmQHN5CCheQXhd0Q","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"2bc554a5cf499303789e1359453d750370bed07d22154b55d845a2c2ef09a333","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"79792f0b18112a65cf4f9f4589b7bdf47861a2b7e787d76e1eade3a051fe71e9"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgdmfY9WmQHN5CCheQXhd0Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:52.375Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgdmfY9WmQHN5CCheQXhd0Q","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":3930,"raw":"3.93K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgdmfY9WmQHN5CCheQXhd0Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:52.375Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"qu